    "name": "Tobacco Road",
    "instructions": "1. Add Mezcal, Cynar, Fino Sherry, and Peychaud's Bitters to a mixing glass with fresh cubed ice.\n2. Stir with a bar spoon until thoroughly chilled and properly diluted.\n3. Strain into a double old fashioned glass over one large ice cube.\n4. Express a grapefruit twist over the surface, then tuck it beside the ice.\n5. Scatter salt lightly across the top of the large ice cube and serve.",
